Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Fix keybody generation; add headless gen_keybody.py;
 vectorize _set_env_state

- h1_view (H1MimicViewMotion) forced no_keybody=False, so MotionLib exit()ed
  because the files it is supposed to generate did not exist yet.
- the *_key_bodies.npy save was commented out (only the W1 dump ran), so the
  README step never produced the files training needs. Save next to each
  motion npy (where MotionLib looks); W1 dump is opt-in via SIGNBOT_SAVE_W1=1.
- gen_keybody.py steps the replay env with zero actions; no dummy policy needed.
- _set_env_state looped over envs in python on every reset.
